#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:1 21b4b1e9768e4dcb97948bddfff05d10
msgid "SQLCODE and SQLSTATE"
msgstr "SQLCODE 和 SQLSTATE"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:3 cb717a9476ab4858bb4821707f641dba
msgid ""
"SQLCODE is an integer value returned by DingoDB driver indicating the "
"error occurs during a database operation."
msgstr ""
"SQLCODE 是 DingoDB 驱动程序返回的整数值，表示数据库操作过程中发生的错误。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:5 553133d0deb0440499ad172f76133531
msgid ""
"SQLSTATE is a code which identifies SQL error conditions. It composed by "
"five characters, which can be numbers or uppercase ASCII letters. An "
"SQLSTATE value consists of a class (first two characters) and a subclass "
"(last three characters). The following SQLSTATE classes are defined in SQL "
"standards:"
msgstr ""
"SQLSTATE 是识别 SQL 错误条件的代码。它由五个字符组成，可以是数字或大写 "
"ASCII 字母。SQLSTATE 值由一个类（前两个字符）和一个子类（后三个字符）组成。"
"SQL 标准中定义了以下 SQLSTATE 类："

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:9 d4f5e7210f91428f994ab7999c86302a
msgid "'00' means 'success'"
msgstr "'00'表示 '成功'"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:10 bc36239bb479428d9aaed85d29d40d7c
msgid "'01' contains all 'warnings'"
msgstr "'01' 包含所有'警告'"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:11 0a7a50ba265349cdb4baa9e040261089
msgid "'02' is the 'NOT FOUND' class"
msgstr "'02'是'未找到'类"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:13 4d16e78e6fc044f28c58cb189eb1d39a
msgid ""
"DingoDB try to make returned SQLCODE and SQLSTATE compatible with MySQL, "
"if the error is not compatible with MySQL, its SQLSTATE is \"45000\"."
msgstr ""
"DingoDB 尝试使返回的 SQLCODE 和 SQLSTATE 与 MySQL 兼容，如果错误与 MySQL 不"
"兼容，则其 SQLSTATE 为 “45000”。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_code_and_state.md:16 f91e1110de314b82a9e37527943bffbc
